    description: "Top LLM assessment improvement suggestion across 5 ZK repos (mean score 68.8): group nodes by directory/module and show inter-module edge counts. This would highlight coupling, suggest architectural improvements, and make outputs less overwhelming for large repos (e.g., penumbra with 10,951 nodes). Needs design discussion: should this be a new CLI subcommand, a flag on existing slice/analyze commands, or a post-processing script?"  # 85eb
